       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TEXT-FIT-CHECKPOINT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 RECORD-A.
          05 LONG-A PIC X(8).
          05 SHORT-A PIC X(3).
          05 RESULT-A PIC X(8).
          05 NUMERIC-PEER PIC 99 COMP-3.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE 'ABCDEFGH' TO LONG-A
           MOVE LONG-A OF RECORD-A TO SHORT-A OF RECORD-A
           MOVE SHORT-A TO RESULT-A
           MOVE 'TOOLONG' TO SHORT-A
           CALL RESULT-A
           GOBACK.
